# POLICE CCTV SUMMARY — CAM10, PAKWAN/PALWAN CROSS ROAD
**Source:** cam10.mp4, 60 minutes, 10:30–11:29, 28-08-2025

## 1. SCENE
Cam10 overlooks Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road, a busy mixed-traffic junction. Footage covers late morning into midday (10:30–11:29). Daylight, no lighting anomalies noted. From min 46 the road surface appeared wet, suggesting recent rain.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
Continuous heavy traffic throughout. Cars predominantly white, plus silver, black, grey, red, maroon, blue and a recurring pink/red hatchback. Dozens of helmeted motorcyclists and scooter riders, some carrying pillions (one motorcyclist carried a gas cylinder, min 9), filtering between lanes throughout. Frequent green-and-yellow CNG auto-rickshaws — 4–10+ per minute during the jam (mins 25–55), including blue and orange goods three-wheelers. Cyclists and pedestrians repeatedly crossed or stood between queued vehicles. Goods vehicles were numerous: box vans, container trucks, tipper, tanker trailers, tarpaulin-covered trucks (including a "Rudra" box van min 2, "SHRIGI GOODS CANVAS" min 25, "PREMIUM EDIBLE" min 40, "PREMIUM CABLES" min 41, "RASHI DEWAXED PREMIUM EDIBLE OILS" min 42, grey "LUCKY"/"AJ ABS WRAP" truck min 19, white "Jamnagar Transport Co." truck min 59). Buses: white Tata bus (min 7), red city bus with Gujarati LED display (min 26, 43–45), yellow Nirma University bus (min 25–27), red AMTS bus (min 44). Other: white ambulance (min 58), white police/traffic van with light bar (min 59), a police vehicle with red-blue light bar (min 49), a yellow JCB-type construction vehicle (min 54), red tractor with tanker trailer (min 12) and blue tanker/bowser (mins 32, 42), Ola-branded electric scooter (min 7).

